{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-logic-python","title":"编程逻辑与 Python","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/programming-database/programming-logic-python","wordCount":833,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"编程逻辑与-python\">编程逻辑与 Python</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>编程的本质是用精确的指令告诉计算机&quot;做什么&quot;和&quot;怎么做&quot;。在学习任何编程语言之前，首先需要建立算法思维——将一个复杂问题拆解为计算机可执行的有序步骤。Python 因其语法简洁、上手快、生态丰富，成为中职学生接触编程的最佳入门语言。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法三大基本结构\">算法三大基本结构</h3><p>所有程序逻辑都可以用三种基本结构的组合来表达：</p>\n<p><strong>顺序结构</strong>：指令按从上到下的顺序逐行执行，这是最基础的结构。</p>\n<p><strong>选择结构（分支）</strong>：根据条件判断决定执行哪条路径。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"temperature = float(input(&quot;请输入当前温度：&quot;))&#10;if temperature &gt;= 35:&#10;    print(&quot;高温预警，注意防暑！&quot;)&#10;elif temperature &gt;= 20:&#10;    print(&quot;气温适宜，适合户外活动。&quot;)&#10;else:&#10;    print(&quot;气温较低，注意保暖。&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">temperature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请输入当前温度：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"高温预警，注意防暑！\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"气温适宜，适合户外活动。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"气温较低，注意保暖。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>循环结构</strong>：重复执行某段代码直到条件不满足。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# for 循环：已知次数&#10;total = 0&#10;for i in range(1, 101):  # 计算 1+2+3+...+100&#10;    total += i&#10;print(f&quot;1到100的和为：{total}&quot;)  # 输出 5050&#10;&#10;# while 循环：条件控制&#10;password = &quot;&quot;&#10;while password != &quot;abc123&quot;:&#10;    password = input(&quot;请输入密码：&quot;)&#10;print(&quot;登录成功！&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shik