<span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> password </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"abc123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    password </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请输入密码：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"登录成功！\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用流程图表示这三种结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;顺序&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;步骤A&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;步骤B&quot;] --&gt; A3[&quot;步骤C&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;选择&quot;&#10;        B1{&quot;条件?&quot;} --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| B2[&quot;路径1&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| B3[&quot;路径2&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;循环&quot;&#10;        C1{&quot;条件成立?&quot;} --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C2[&quot;循环体&quot;]&#10;        C2 --&gt; C1&#10;        C1 --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| C3[&quot;退出循环&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"顺序\"\n        A1[\"步骤A\"] --&gt; A2[\"步骤B\"] --&gt; A3[\"步骤C\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"选择\"\n        B1{\"条件?\"} --&gt;|\"是\"| B2[\"路径1\"]\n        B1 --&gt;|\"否\"| B3[\"路径2\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"循环\"\n        C1{\"条件成立?\"} --&gt;|\"是\"| C2[\"循环体\"]\n        C2 --&gt; C1\n        C1 --&gt;|\"否\"| C3[\"退出循环\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"python-核心语法\">Python 核心语法</h3><p><strong>变量与数据类型</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"name = &quot;张三&quot;         # 字符串 str&#10;age = 18              # 整数 int&#10;score = 89.5          # 浮点数 float&#10;is_passed = True      # 布尔值 bool\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"张三\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # 字符串 str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 18</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 整数 int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 89.5</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 浮点数 float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">is_passed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 布尔值 bool</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>列表（List）</strong>——有序可变集合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"fruits = [&quot;苹果&quot;, &quot;香蕉&quot;, &quot;橙子&quot;]&#10;fruits.append(&quot;葡萄&quot;)      # 添加元素&#10;fruits.remove(&quot;香蕉&quot;)      # 删除元素&#10;print(fruits[0])           # 访问第一个元素：苹果&#10;print(len(fruits))         # 列表长度：3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fruits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"苹果\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"香蕉\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"橙子\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fruits.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"葡萄\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fruits.remove(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"香蕉\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 删除元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fruits[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 访问第一个元素：苹果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><spa